WEBVTT

01:47.300 --> 01:51.940
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

01:52.060 --> 01:54.980
[Episode 15]
[This story is purely fictional]

02:13.430 --> 02:14.290
Remove the plaque!

02:23.630 --> 02:24.450
My child,

02:25.520 --> 02:27.450
how does it feel to hold power?

02:28.680 --> 02:30.850
How does it feel to watch yourself

02:30.870 --> 02:32.260
hurt the women you care about?

02:32.870 --> 02:34.620
The embroidery workshop you founded

02:35.280 --> 02:36.570
fell from grace.

02:37.150 --> 02:39.410
The fruit of your lifetime's hard work

02:39.430 --> 02:40.540
became worthless,

02:41.000 --> 02:41.980
stepped on by everyone.

02:42.960 --> 02:44.820
Are you not disappointed in yourself?

02:51.750 --> 02:52.940
If I were you,

02:54.240 --> 02:57.130
I would be so disappointed in myself.

02:58.030 --> 02:58.690
Because you

02:59.120 --> 03:00.540
used to believe so firmly

03:01.400 --> 03:03.540
that if you could take over the Huo Clan,

03:04.080 --> 03:06.060
you would lead it better than your aunts

03:06.080 --> 03:06.890
ever did.

03:07.910 --> 03:09.260
But the truth is,

03:10.150 --> 03:11.820
you tried that in your previous life.

03:13.000 --> 03:13.730
In the end,

03:14.360 --> 03:16.610
you failed to save anyone.

03:18.030 --> 03:19.660
You even became the person

03:19.680 --> 03:21.540
you hated the most.

03:24.240 --> 03:25.170
So you're saying

03:27.870 --> 03:30.100
that even after I take over the Huo Clan,

03:31.840 --> 03:33.380
I'll still make the same mistake.

03:35.120 --> 03:36.980
I'll hurt my clan mates

03:39.430 --> 03:41.260
like my aunts did

03:42.750 --> 03:43.730
and lead

03:46.220 --> 03:47.310
my clan to doom.

03:49.680 --> 03:51.050
That is the way it is.

03:51.840 --> 03:52.940
You are stuck

03:53.400 --> 03:56.130
in this cycle of tragedy.

03:57.080 --> 03:57.730
And you

03:59.430 --> 04:01.130
are too powerless to change it.

04:02.310 --> 04:03.500
If that is true,

04:04.960 --> 04:06.260
then the blame should be on the world

04:07.710 --> 04:08.850
and this destiny.

04:12.430 --> 04:13.380
Enough talking.

04:13.870 --> 04:14.890
If this world is flawed,

04:15.470 --> 04:16.540
I shall be the one to change it.

04:17.120 --> 04:17.540
I

04:19.160 --> 04:20.700
will not make the same mistake.

04:35.620 --> 04:39.060
[Staying True to Principles]

04:41.060 --> 04:55.540
[Shushen Hall]

05:00.700 --> 05:02.860
[Memorial Tablet of Huo Clan's Great Matron]

05:02.860 --> 05:05.020
[Memorial Tablet of Huo Clan's Founding Matron]

05:06.390 --> 05:07.020
Miss Huo,

05:08.190 --> 05:09.700
the elders are all dead.

05:10.040 --> 05:10.810
According to the rules,

05:11.240 --> 05:12.290
we have to appoint new members

05:12.310 --> 05:13.460
for the sisters guild.

05:15.510 --> 05:16.340
Tell everyone

05:17.040 --> 05:18.460
that the Huo Sisters Guild is no more.

05:21.830 --> 05:22.290
But...

05:22.560 --> 05:23.220
Moving forward,

05:24.830 --> 05:25.730
our clan rules

05:28.120 --> 05:29.140
will change.

05:31.310 --> 05:32.700
Miss Huo,

05:33.360 --> 05:34.220
our ancestors

05:34.560 --> 05:36.460
established the sisters guild a century ago.

05:36.800 --> 05:38.340
Everyone in the Mystic Nine knows that.

05:38.830 --> 05:40.290
If you remove the guild now,

05:40.920 --> 05:41.930
won't the Mystic Nine

05:43.070 --> 05:45.020
make a fuss about it?

05:47.040 --> 05:49.140
If the Mystic Nine chooses to follow the antiquated rules

05:49.190 --> 05:50.220
instead of evolving with modern times,

05:50.600 --> 05:51.540
then their comments

05:52.310 --> 05:53.370
have no value to us.

05:57.510 --> 05:58.100
Miss Huo,

05:58.510 --> 06:00.220
we will follow you no matter what.

06:00.360 --> 06:01.020
With you here,

06:01.360 --> 06:03.220
our clan will see a new dawn.

07:23.430 --> 07:24.100
It's poisonous.

07:35.720 --> 07:36.410
This herb

07:36.680 --> 07:37.700
is like a narcotic fruit.

07:39.000 --> 07:39.660
A bird will be stupefied

07:39.680 --> 07:40.690
if it nibbles it.

07:41.830 --> 07:43.340
We can use this to tame the beast.

07:50.950 --> 07:51.700
It's not enough.

07:52.430 --> 07:53.900
Gather more in other places.

08:23.190 --> 08:24.050
What are you doing?

08:24.430 --> 08:25.290
I'm going in myself.

10:16.360 --> 10:17.300
Since we're already here,

10:18.150 --> 10:19.530
let me show you a place.

10:41.200 --> 10:42.010
Do you see that?

10:42.870 --> 10:43.700
Do you know what that is?

10:45.390 --> 10:47.490
We found mummified corpses here.

10:54.750 --> 10:56.850
Do you know what they are?

10:58.200 --> 10:58.890
Ascension.

11:00.320 --> 11:01.130
Ascension?

11:01.630 --> 11:03.010
We have cultivators

11:03.630 --> 11:05.250
who trained in solitude deep inside

11:05.480 --> 11:06.220
a cave.

11:06.910 --> 11:08.300
They want to attain divinity,

11:09.320 --> 11:10.420
a transcendence of the soul.

11:11.390 --> 11:13.530
These are their mortal shells after their ascension.

11:16.000 --> 11:16.850
You won't understand anyway.

11:18.270 --> 11:19.890
You're just making things up.

11:20.750 --> 11:21.420
Let's continue.

11:46.030 --> 11:46.820
What is that?

11:48.870 --> 11:51.460
[Resting Place of Loyal Souls]
Our fallen comrades.

11:54.720 --> 11:55.940
Follow my hand

11:57.000 --> 11:57.890
and look over there.

12:00.390 --> 12:02.180
There is a bigger monster

12:02.320 --> 12:03.980
inside the pond in front.

12:05.320 --> 12:06.370
We lost

12:06.510 --> 12:08.180
many men here.

12:11.200 --> 12:12.010
You don't

12:12.960 --> 12:14.220
look upset at all.

12:14.790 --> 12:15.850
In fact, you're excited.

12:16.320 --> 12:17.580
The greater the casualty,

12:18.150 --> 12:19.250
the stronger

12:19.840 --> 12:21.460
the monster is.

12:23.120 --> 12:23.820
You're insane.

12:25.120 --> 12:27.530
You just haven't seen its charm yet.

12:28.750 --> 12:30.220
It is a league above

12:32.240 --> 12:35.180
the one you're taming.

12:38.150 --> 12:39.100
And it

12:39.600 --> 12:40.650
will appear soon.

12:46.030 --> 12:46.730
Wu Laogou.

12:47.240 --> 12:48.300
Can you tame it?

12:52.030 --> 12:53.420
Can you?

13:02.500 --> 13:10.140
[Wu's Residence]

13:59.340 --> 14:04.340
♪Folding time into paper kites that fly before my eyes♪

14:05.340 --> 14:10.500
♪Your beauty resembles a pristine portrait♪

14:10.900 --> 14:15.860
♪When will the white horse return? I keep thinking about you♪

14:16.420 --> 14:21.860
♪I ask the water of Yique, who has moved into my heart?♪

14:22.300 --> 14:28.180
♪Pinching time with my fingertips, my longing for you keeps me awake♪

14:28.180 --> 14:34.140
♪The smile as you look back is as bright as a flower♪

14:34.580 --> 14:39.740
♪The story continues for millennia, and your beauty remains♪

14:40.060 --> 14:47.180
♪In this turbulent life, you're always next to me♪

14:50.100 --> 14:55.460
♪Don't wait until the flowers are in full bloom♪

14:56.020 --> 15:01.340
♪Don't let your misguided devotion squander away your youth♪

15:01.580 --> 15:07.180
♪Even after a few cycles of time♪

15:07.660 --> 15:13.460
♪I wish my heart still lights up the way we first met♪

15:13.860 --> 15:19.300
♪Don't say the flowers tonight haven't lost their fragrance♪

15:19.860 --> 15:25.180
♪Don't wait until your life becomes full of regrets♪

15:25.390 --> 15:27.420
I don't know where Laogou is.

15:30.510 --> 15:32.130
Everyone left to look for him.

15:35.390 --> 15:36.940
But I have a hunch

15:38.870 --> 15:39.850
that he will be safe.

15:42.120 --> 15:43.010
He will return.

15:45.360 --> 15:47.130
You feel that too, don't you?

15:49.750 --> 15:51.610
Staying here is safe.

15:53.720 --> 15:54.850
If there's nothing left to eat,

15:55.600 --> 15:56.580
just come to me.

15:57.320 --> 15:57.770
Okay?

17:02.270 --> 17:02.890
This is what you need.

17:14.360 --> 17:14.900
It's wrong.

17:17.030 --> 17:17.660
Make another.

17:18.600 --> 17:19.250
You!

17:43.590 --> 17:45.770
I made this for you.

17:46.110 --> 17:46.900
It's delicious.

17:47.590 --> 17:48.290
Enjoy.

18:33.510 --> 18:36.140
Interesting herbs.

19:12.750 --> 19:13.730
My throat is itchy.

19:15.200 --> 19:15.940
My chest is stuffy.

19:20.550 --> 19:21.770
My fingers are numb.

20:53.640 --> 20:54.730
Tea claw vine?

21:05.350 --> 21:05.980
I'm

21:07.030 --> 21:07.940
at Xiangxi.

21:15.220 --> 21:17.580
[Xiangxi]

21:23.030 --> 21:23.860
Master Zhang,

21:24.110 --> 21:25.530
do you think Fifth Master is suffering?

21:26.400 --> 21:27.490
He has a rough childhood.

21:28.270 --> 21:29.090
So don't worry about him.

21:29.440 --> 21:30.330
I was kidnapped once.

21:31.160 --> 21:32.050
And every day,

21:32.200 --> 21:33.250
I wondered if I could get out alive,

21:33.440 --> 21:34.770
or if somebody

21:34.920 --> 21:35.810
could cave me.

21:36.350 --> 21:38.010
That's different from being tortured.

21:38.680 --> 21:40.050
Unlike you, Fifth Master won't just sit around

21:40.550 --> 21:41.660
and let others torture him.

21:42.200 --> 21:42.660
Master Zhang,

21:43.200 --> 21:43.770
you're handing out

21:43.790 --> 21:44.700
a lot of compliments now.

21:46.110 --> 21:47.980
He's gone. Stop jinxing it.

21:49.640 --> 21:50.380
Stupid Yu.

21:50.400 --> 21:51.530
That's not what you should be saying now.

21:52.480 --> 21:53.660
Fifth Master is missing,

21:53.830 --> 21:54.770
not gone.

21:55.550 --> 21:56.810
I do worry about him.

21:56.920 --> 21:58.860
But if we don't keep ourselves safe,

21:59.110 --> 22:00.380
we'll die before he does.

22:01.550 --> 22:02.090
Master Zhang,

22:02.480 --> 22:03.530
where are we going?

22:04.440 --> 22:05.810
To the 82 Stockade

22:06.400 --> 22:07.180
and talk to their leader.

22:09.860 --> 22:14.260
[Heimao Stockade, Xiangxi]

22:17.780 --> 22:19.860
[Heimao Stockade]

22:21.830 --> 22:22.420
Who are you?

22:23.030 --> 22:24.860
Zhang Qishan, Changsha Defense Commander.

22:24.920 --> 22:27.810
I'm here to see the leader of 82 Stockade.

22:27.960 --> 22:28.940
Wait here.

22:31.550 --> 22:33.940
I didn't know your influence extends

22:34.240 --> 22:35.250
to a remote place like this.

22:35.920 --> 22:36.460
Impressive.

22:37.110 --> 22:37.810
The last few years

22:38.240 --> 22:39.490
have been tumultuous.

22:40.000 --> 22:41.770
The Ministry of War wants me to build a rapport with 82 Stockade.

22:42.550 --> 22:43.250
But it's best

22:43.960 --> 22:45.050
to avoid them as much as possible.

22:45.880 --> 22:46.460
Why?

22:54.310 --> 22:55.570
Chief is old.

22:55.790 --> 22:57.050
He only allows you to enter alone.

22:58.680 --> 22:59.700
Wait for me here.

23:09.570 --> 23:12.330
What an attitude from an old chief.

23:12.830 --> 23:13.530
I heard

23:14.070 --> 23:15.980
when they assimilated tribal leaders in the Yongzheng era,

23:16.400 --> 23:18.140
he was already the head of 82 Stockade.

23:18.310 --> 23:19.220
Assimilation of tribal leaders?

23:20.590 --> 23:21.940
Then he's over 100 years old.

23:22.550 --> 23:24.420
Can someone live that long?

23:25.000 --> 23:25.460
Of course.

23:26.400 --> 23:28.900
I know several others.

24:27.980 --> 24:31.780
[Chief of Heimao Stockade]

24:57.510 --> 24:59.220
After so many years, your room still hasn't changed at all.

25:00.270 --> 25:00.940
But you

25:01.830 --> 25:02.420
have aged a lot.

25:04.440 --> 25:06.460
Vicious words.

25:07.880 --> 25:10.900
I almost thought you were the Underworld King who wants to take my life.

25:12.880 --> 25:16.330
You're just as young.

25:17.880 --> 25:19.250
Your time is not up yet.

25:20.480 --> 25:21.860
You may only die after you answer

25:23.200 --> 25:24.010
my questions.

25:24.440 --> 25:26.090
I knew it.

25:26.590 --> 25:29.090
You're not here for a visit.

25:30.550 --> 25:31.730
Just

25:32.750 --> 25:34.090
cut to the chase.

25:34.720 --> 25:35.180
One.

25:36.200 --> 25:37.090
Did the Japanese

25:37.920 --> 25:38.980
come to Xiangxi?

25:39.310 --> 25:39.770
Two.

25:40.400 --> 25:41.490
The Otherworld Patriarch

25:42.070 --> 25:43.460
cultivated in a cave here in Xiangxi.

25:44.310 --> 25:45.250
Do you know

25:45.750 --> 25:46.490
which cave it is?

25:47.240 --> 25:47.730
Three.

25:48.310 --> 25:49.620
Is there a place in Xiangxi

25:50.920 --> 25:52.140
only accessible through underground rivers?

25:52.790 --> 25:54.250
A place you can't reach on foot.

25:58.270 --> 25:59.050
One.

26:00.200 --> 26:01.420
The Japanese

26:01.750 --> 26:04.860
are deep inside Mount Heimen.

26:05.750 --> 26:07.940
That is a sacred mountain.

26:08.590 --> 26:10.730
You can only enter it on foot.

26:11.640 --> 26:12.380
Two.

26:13.110 --> 26:14.620
The cave you're looking for

26:15.240 --> 26:16.730
is in the mountain.

26:18.000 --> 26:19.900
Three.

26:20.830 --> 26:22.140
No such place

26:24.160 --> 26:24.900
outside the mountain.

26:25.590 --> 26:27.140
But perhaps in the mountain.

26:29.000 --> 26:31.770
I do not know the answer

26:33.110 --> 26:33.980
because

26:34.790 --> 26:36.220
no one has ever returned alive

26:37.310 --> 26:41.220
from the mountain.

26:43.880 --> 26:45.220
But the Japanese went in.

26:46.680 --> 26:48.290
Where is Mount Heimen?

26:48.960 --> 26:50.050
Tell me how I can get there.

26:50.400 --> 26:52.140
I don't know how the Japanese

26:52.830 --> 26:53.770
went in.

26:55.070 --> 26:56.810
But you won't be able to enter

26:57.960 --> 26:58.980
because

27:01.440 --> 27:03.620
a mountain deity lives there.

27:07.160 --> 27:08.330
Unless...

27:25.750 --> 27:26.860
Unless

27:29.310 --> 27:31.290
you bring a baby with you.

27:31.480 --> 27:33.940
He can lead you away from the mountain deity.

27:34.200 --> 27:35.860
Babies are often the most perceptive.

27:36.070 --> 27:38.220
They can sense the mountain deity.

27:38.480 --> 27:39.530
If not,

27:40.400 --> 27:42.490
all of you will be in grave danger.

27:46.110 --> 27:47.940
What exactly is the mountain deity?

27:54.400 --> 27:56.940
We have never seen it.

27:57.640 --> 27:59.090
Our ancestors have made a pact

27:59.550 --> 28:00.420
with it.

28:01.240 --> 28:02.050
Every year,

28:03.960 --> 28:08.700
we'll offer livestock to it.

28:09.110 --> 28:11.330
It will protect the stockade.

28:11.750 --> 28:12.700
If not,

28:14.680 --> 28:16.810
we'll suffer great misfortune.

28:19.310 --> 28:23.140
The Qing Dynasty discontinued this ritual,

28:23.830 --> 28:26.180
so we stopped doing that.

28:27.680 --> 28:29.220
That was when we stopped

28:29.680 --> 28:31.010
seeing people

28:31.310 --> 28:34.490
returning alive from the mountain.

28:35.200 --> 28:39.220
If you promise to help me give offerings to the mountain deity,

28:39.880 --> 28:42.620
I'll ask my men to bring a baby with you

28:43.240 --> 28:44.900
to the mountain.

28:46.550 --> 28:47.090
You have a deal.

28:49.550 --> 28:50.660
The Japanese

28:52.070 --> 28:53.490
disregarded our rules.

28:54.350 --> 28:55.250
My foster son

28:56.160 --> 28:59.730
will enter the mountain with you together with his men

29:00.880 --> 29:02.460
to kill them.

29:03.440 --> 29:05.570
Make sure to protect the baby.

29:06.510 --> 29:09.090
He is the key to your survival.

29:14.070 --> 29:16.010
I too wish to enter the mountain with you.

29:17.030 --> 29:17.730
If only

29:19.720 --> 29:21.050
I were younger

29:21.750 --> 29:23.730
and could live longer.

29:24.750 --> 29:25.380
Living longer

29:27.830 --> 29:30.460
is not necessarily a good thing.

29:33.400 --> 29:34.770
I've known you for years.

29:36.550 --> 29:38.090
I don't know what you're keeping here.

29:39.240 --> 29:40.980
But look at your current state.

29:41.590 --> 29:42.530
If you want to live longer,

29:43.880 --> 29:44.810
stop keeping it.

30:16.510 --> 30:17.380
We made a new one.

30:51.000 --> 30:51.530
It works.

30:52.750 --> 30:53.460
It works?

30:58.200 --> 30:58.940
Great.

31:36.310 --> 31:37.660
Do you always come here to watch plays?

31:38.640 --> 31:39.140
No.

31:40.160 --> 31:41.180
If I had time,

31:41.680 --> 31:42.900
I would sneak out.

31:44.640 --> 31:45.220
I understand.

31:45.960 --> 31:47.530
Another one of those prestigious family rules.

31:49.920 --> 31:51.460
Do you think I'm that obedient?

31:51.680 --> 31:52.490
Of course, not.

31:54.000 --> 31:54.660
That's why

31:56.310 --> 31:57.570
I think we're alike.

32:03.070 --> 32:04.290
The play is over.

32:05.350 --> 32:06.250
Are you not going back?

32:08.240 --> 32:09.250
I love it

32:09.680 --> 32:10.860
when the play ends.

32:13.590 --> 32:14.220
How come?

32:16.510 --> 32:18.180
Iridescent clouds dissipate quickly. Colored glass is fragile.

32:19.440 --> 32:20.490
It seems like everything in this world

32:21.790 --> 32:24.050
is destined to meet a tragic end.

32:27.110 --> 32:28.250
It's a wonderful night,

32:28.680 --> 32:29.860
and it will end soon.

32:30.590 --> 32:31.490
I should get used to this feeling

32:31.750 --> 32:32.660
as soon as possible.

32:35.880 --> 32:36.730
I beg to differ.

32:39.240 --> 32:40.810
If the play is mesmerizing enough,

32:42.680 --> 32:43.530
in my heart,

32:45.270 --> 32:46.220
it will never end.

32:51.200 --> 32:52.220
So things I hold dear

32:52.640 --> 32:54.290
will never meet a tragic end.

33:02.240 --> 33:02.900
Perhaps.

33:06.000 --> 33:06.420
Look.

33:07.270 --> 33:09.330
The Big Dipper is so bright tonight.

33:12.110 --> 33:12.810
May

33:15.030 --> 33:17.290
it remain like this forever.

33:19.310 --> 33:20.290
It is beautiful.

33:21.920 --> 33:23.010
Growing up, I've seen

33:23.030 --> 33:24.140
many wondrous trinkets.

33:25.750 --> 33:27.290
But none of them holds a candle

33:28.070 --> 33:29.530
to the Big Dipper.

33:39.440 --> 33:40.620
Until the day I met you.

33:41.510 --> 33:43.050
When you came to defend me, you were more beautiful

33:44.750 --> 33:45.570
than the stars.

33:50.680 --> 33:52.330
The stars are so far away from me.

33:54.350 --> 33:55.460
I wonder if she

33:56.550 --> 33:57.460
will notice me.

34:07.720 --> 34:08.610
Wherever you are,

34:14.670 --> 34:15.610
she will always notice you.

34:41.230 --> 34:42.820
Laogou, run.

34:43.190 --> 34:44.050
Run!

34:53.920 --> 34:55.300
This starry sky

34:56.360 --> 34:59.210
will be ours soon.

35:00.360 --> 35:01.050
Mr. Wu,

35:01.480 --> 35:02.490
thank you for your assistance.

35:16.400 --> 35:16.940
No.

35:17.960 --> 35:18.490
I have to...

35:19.400 --> 35:20.650
I have to escape this place.

36:07.400 --> 36:07.980
Cui.

36:08.670 --> 36:09.530
Bring this out.

36:10.190 --> 36:10.860
Find Xiangu.

36:28.670 --> 36:30.260
Xiangu will find me.

36:31.670 --> 36:33.130
She will.

36:52.340 --> 36:55.780
[Huo's Residence]

36:58.780 --> 37:01.980
[Shushen Hall]

37:08.110 --> 37:09.420
Congratulations, Miss Huo.

37:09.670 --> 37:11.490
You overcame your family feud

37:12.320 --> 37:14.010
and took over the clan for real.

37:22.840 --> 37:23.780
I heard

37:24.510 --> 37:25.380
that you

37:26.150 --> 37:27.460
do not like the Japanese.

37:27.880 --> 37:29.780
Changsha forbids any Japanese from entering.

37:30.760 --> 37:32.090
How come you can enter here

37:32.710 --> 37:33.610
so freely?

37:34.170 --> 37:37.340
We have a special permit from the government.

37:37.710 --> 37:39.530
We can stay in Changsha for 12 hours.

37:41.880 --> 37:42.490
Take a look.

37:43.550 --> 37:45.650
This is the total amount the Japanese Chamber of Commerce

37:45.960 --> 37:47.130
[Huo, Confidential]
invested in your clan.

37:47.710 --> 37:48.420
It's an amount

37:49.550 --> 37:52.820
you're incapable of repaying.

37:56.670 --> 37:58.010
That said, we do not lack funding.

37:58.480 --> 37:59.420
We just want

37:59.510 --> 38:01.260
to be friends with you.

38:04.710 --> 38:08.050
I was told you contracted the black plague in the mine.

38:08.960 --> 38:09.780
As a token of sincerity,

38:10.710 --> 38:12.980
I spent a fortune to purchase a batch of special medicine.

38:13.510 --> 38:15.170
It will cure all of you.

38:17.070 --> 38:18.460
What do you want?

38:20.070 --> 38:20.860
Miss Huo.

38:21.510 --> 38:23.740
If you continue working with us,

38:24.440 --> 38:25.050
your clan

38:25.920 --> 38:27.940
will be the leader of the Mystic Nine.

38:30.230 --> 38:31.380
Becoming the leader of the Mystic Nine

38:31.380 --> 38:32.820
is not an advantage per se.

38:34.070 --> 38:35.170
It's not the only thing

38:36.030 --> 38:37.010
my clan wants.

38:39.590 --> 38:40.860
How forthcoming of you.

38:41.920 --> 38:42.530
Don't worry.

38:43.510 --> 38:45.460
We, the Japanese, are very generous.

38:45.960 --> 38:47.420
We can give you

38:48.550 --> 38:50.010
whatever you want.

38:54.630 --> 38:55.740
Partners?

39:36.980 --> 39:38.220
[Ma Jinbao]

39:39.180 --> 39:40.220
[Su Amei]

39:59.110 --> 39:59.530
Master,

40:01.190 --> 40:02.210
82 Stockade entrusted

40:02.230 --> 40:03.900
such an important ritual to us.

40:05.070 --> 40:06.490
Then, they sent their men to follow us.

40:07.230 --> 40:07.820
What are they trying to do?

40:09.030 --> 40:12.570
Whenever a group is sent into Mount Heimen,

40:13.840 --> 40:15.300
only the leader comes out.

40:16.590 --> 40:17.610
So in this trip,

40:19.510 --> 40:20.650
we are the offerings?

40:22.670 --> 40:24.740
They never want us to return alive.

40:26.150 --> 40:26.690
Master Zhang.

40:27.590 --> 40:29.210
This place is an ill omen.

40:29.630 --> 40:31.010
You always say there is an ill omen.

40:31.590 --> 40:32.460
Where is it?

40:35.230 --> 40:35.650
Master,

40:36.760 --> 40:37.780
you're on good terms

40:37.960 --> 40:38.690
with Stockade 82.

40:39.440 --> 40:40.460
Are they really trying to get you killed?

40:42.230 --> 40:43.090
Desperate times

40:44.070 --> 40:45.820
will often blind one's moral compass.

40:46.920 --> 40:48.900
For the Chief, the citizens of Stockade 82

40:49.670 --> 40:51.740
are his responsibilities.

40:52.760 --> 40:53.740
He will do anything,

40:54.670 --> 40:55.650
right or wrong,

40:55.760 --> 40:56.530
to protect the citizens.

40:57.550 --> 40:58.420
Naturally, our lives

40:59.280 --> 41:00.980
can be sacrificed.

41:06.500 --> 41:07.340
So they...

41:07.710 --> 41:09.050
They don't trust us.

41:09.830 --> 41:11.490
They are here to help us

41:12.070 --> 41:13.300
and to keep us in check.

41:13.630 --> 41:14.300
Keep us in check?

41:15.070 --> 41:15.780
They really think they can?

41:16.630 --> 41:18.530
Do not underestimate a man who will die soon.

41:20.070 --> 41:20.940
A man who will die soon?

41:23.510 --> 41:24.380
There is a rule.

41:25.630 --> 41:26.780
Everything in the mountain

41:27.190 --> 41:28.170
belongs to the mountain deity.

41:28.840 --> 41:29.780
If they kill the Japanese,

41:30.590 --> 41:31.820
they will offend the mountain deity.

41:32.550 --> 41:34.690
So before they came, they took a pill.

41:35.480 --> 41:37.780
A poisonous pill that will kill them after a week.

41:39.140 --> 41:40.920
This is their last mission

41:41.190 --> 41:42.090
before they die.

41:50.040 --> 41:50.650
Master,

41:51.670 --> 41:53.630
what exactly is the mountain deity?

41:55.000 --> 41:56.380
It is our prey.

41:58.110 --> 41:59.610
Just kill it

42:00.480 --> 42:01.650
and the Japanese.

42:02.230 --> 42:02.650
Master Zhang.

42:03.480 --> 42:04.340
As the saying goes,

42:04.760 --> 42:06.900
keep your friends close, and your enemies closer.

42:07.760 --> 42:09.010
Do not underestimate our foes.

42:10.030 --> 42:12.210
That thing has lived for centuries.

42:12.630 --> 42:13.380
I'm sure

42:13.670 --> 42:14.570
many bold hunters

42:14.590 --> 42:16.010
have tried to kill it.

42:16.280 --> 42:17.260
But they all failed.

42:17.760 --> 42:18.460
That means

42:19.070 --> 42:21.650
it has withstood the trial of time.

42:23.000 --> 42:24.820
And I hate those who live longer than they should.

42:26.590 --> 42:27.490
- Master Zhang. - Eighth Master.

42:28.030 --> 42:29.860
Have you seen anything more ruthless than us?

42:30.590 --> 42:32.050
- But you... - Eighth Master.

42:32.320 --> 42:33.690
Keep the gun properly. You might misfire it.

42:35.150 --> 42:35.970
Sure.

42:36.480 --> 42:37.210
Don't worry.

42:38.070 --> 42:38.780
Listen.

42:39.320 --> 42:40.420
Before I left,

42:40.710 --> 42:41.570
I performed a divination.

42:42.110 --> 42:42.740
This trip

42:43.030 --> 42:45.050
will be safe. And I might

42:45.510 --> 42:46.300
get lucky with girls.

42:47.190 --> 42:48.380
Perhaps when we return to Heimao Stockade,

42:48.510 --> 42:50.260
a beauty will fall for me.

42:50.550 --> 42:53.340
And the Qi's bloodline shall continue...

42:54.880 --> 42:55.860
Let me finish!

43:25.000 --> 43:26.650
For you. Try it.

43:46.550 --> 43:47.820
That's a treasure, Master Zhang.

43:48.510 --> 43:50.260
You can only find this in Xiangxi.

43:50.920 --> 43:51.610
Quick.

43:52.070 --> 43:53.130
Share it with everyone.

43:53.630 --> 43:54.530
Let them try it.

44:02.710 --> 44:03.260
Thanks.

44:10.360 --> 44:10.820
Master Zhang.

44:11.510 --> 44:12.130
Is there

44:12.590 --> 44:13.570
a way

44:13.630 --> 44:14.820
to save these dying people?

44:16.590 --> 44:17.210
No.

44:18.630 --> 44:19.650
Xiangxi is a land of poison.

44:20.230 --> 44:21.380
Only the locals can make the antidotes.

44:22.320 --> 44:23.570
I cannot save those who wish for death.

44:38.670 --> 44:38.940
Thank you.

44:38.960 --> 44:39.570
I'll be frank with you.

44:40.880 --> 44:41.900
In this trip,

44:42.320 --> 44:43.740
we will kill the mountain deity.

44:45.510 --> 44:46.010
This is good.

44:49.710 --> 44:50.490
Kill

44:51.150 --> 44:51.980
the mountain deity?

44:56.880 --> 44:57.780
You'd better

44:59.920 --> 45:01.050
kill it thoroughly.

45:06.480 --> 45:07.340
You're not going to stop me?

45:11.760 --> 45:13.260
If the mountain deity can be killed,

45:13.960 --> 45:14.650
then it

45:15.110 --> 45:16.130
is not a deity at all.

45:17.280 --> 45:17.900
We

45:18.510 --> 45:19.380
won't be afraid of it.

45:20.840 --> 45:22.010
If it kills you,

45:22.880 --> 45:23.980
dying to it

45:24.760 --> 45:26.090
is the best way to die.

45:43.400 --> 45:44.130
So?

45:45.590 --> 45:46.780
Have you tamed it?

47:44.670 --> 47:46.300
I knew I got the right person.

47:54.000 --> 47:56.300
So much for the secret of the Otherworld Tower.

47:57.550 --> 47:58.690
If you had truly mastered its secret,

47:59.590 --> 48:01.260
you wouldn't have been so afraid of a beast.

48:01.630 --> 48:02.940
It is not a beast.

48:05.880 --> 48:07.260
Its name is Zhainiangniang.

48:08.320 --> 48:09.610
It was first recorded in the writings

48:09.670 --> 48:11.090
of Yin Changsheng.

48:12.070 --> 48:12.820
People

48:13.400 --> 48:15.130
also call it the mountain deity.

48:16.550 --> 48:18.650
You have no idea how beautiful

48:18.760 --> 48:21.460
and captivating creatures like it are.

48:25.360 --> 48:26.090
And now...

50:14.030 --> 50:15.300
If you blow that whistle,

50:15.840 --> 50:17.260
it will obey whatever command

50:17.400 --> 50:18.530
you give it?

50:19.230 --> 50:19.940
I think so.

50:21.280 --> 50:22.460
So, can you now go

50:23.360 --> 50:24.530
to the place you want to go?

50:25.480 --> 50:26.130
Yes.

50:27.670 --> 50:28.820
Yes.

50:29.590 --> 50:31.090
I'll bring you over.

50:32.550 --> 50:33.690
You can also

50:36.320 --> 50:38.130
release it now.

50:58.700 --> 51:02.860
♪The past fades like smoke♪

51:03.220 --> 51:05.940
♪A choice is made in silence♪

51:06.220 --> 51:09.020
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

51:09.420 --> 51:13.180
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

51:13.420 --> 51:16.860
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

51:17.140 --> 51:20.540
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

51:20.620 --> 51:27.900
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

51:28.340 --> 51:31.620
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

51:31.900 --> 51:35.140
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

51:35.300 --> 51:39.340
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

51:39.540 --> 51:42.900
♪Who believes in fate?♪

51:43.140 --> 51:46.500
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

51:46.740 --> 51:50.020
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

51:50.340 --> 51:54.020
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

51:54.220 --> 51:57.460
♪Take care♪

51:57.460 --> 52:00.020
♪We once raced♪

52:00.100 --> 52:02.020
♪For the dawn♪

52:02.180 --> 52:05.460
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

52:05.580 --> 52:08.860
♪In the web of fate♪

52:08.860 --> 52:12.060
♪No one can escape♪

52:13.060 --> 52:14.900
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

52:15.060 --> 52:16.620
♪We too were young once♪

52:16.700 --> 52:20.140
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

52:20.340 --> 52:22.660
♪Keep the ember lit♪

52:22.780 --> 52:27.300
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

52:27.420 --> 52:30.380
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

52:30.620 --> 52:34.140
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

52:34.260 --> 52:38.020
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

52:38.340 --> 52:41.820
♪Who believes in fate?♪

52:41.980 --> 52:44.980
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

52:45.220 --> 52:48.980
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

52:49.140 --> 52:52.860
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

52:52.980 --> 53:04.420
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
